{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "\n原因：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nReason: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "结束设备预览": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End Device Preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在查询你的录音…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Searching your recordings…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已整理好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音已结束": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording ended"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览录音开始提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview Recording Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览录音结束提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview Recording End"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览 · 正在录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview · Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览 · 录音已结束": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview · Recording ended"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览时长": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview duration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒转写返回的数据格式不对，请检查接口地址是否为兼容 OpenAI 的转写服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box returned an unexpected response. Check that the endpoint supports OpenAI-compatible transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒转写服务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box transcription service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒整理服务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box notes service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒转写": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒整理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用密盒上配置的模型整理纪要、回答提问和翻译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the configured Mi Box model for notes, questions, and translation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用上面选定的整理模型逐句翻译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translate each sentence with the model selected above for notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个服务没给列表，可以直接填写模型名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This service did not return a list. Enter a model name directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先刷新列表，也可以直接填写模型名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh the list or enter a model name directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在模型设置中填写有效的密盒转写接口地址和模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a valid Mi Box transcription endpoint and model in Model Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在模型设置中填写有效的密盒分析接口地址和模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a valid Mi Box analysis endpoint and model in Model Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒请求失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box request failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接密盒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect Mi Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒未连接。想现在就录，也可以使用这台 Mac。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box is not connected. You can also record using this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TeleAgent 正在切换账号。请先打开 TeleAgent 完成账号切换，再退出后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TeleAgent is switching accounts. Open TeleAgent to finish the switch, then quit and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude、Codex、OpenClaw、TeleAgent、Grok Bot": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude, Codex, OpenClaw, TeleAgent, Grok Bot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机分析模型等了五分钟还没就绪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local analysis model was not ready after five minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没找到所选本机转写模型文件。请在设置里下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected local transcription model files were not found. Download them in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该模型正在由其他程序下载，请等待完成后再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another program is downloading this model. Wait for it to finish and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型文件大小不符，请检查模型文件夹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model file has an unexpected size. Check the model folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型文件已被其他程序更新，请检查后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another program changed the model file. Check it and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 已下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Downloaded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 还没下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Not downloaded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转写模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local transcription model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机整理模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local summarization model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model files"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把录音转成文字。可在设置中选择 Qwen3-ASR 或 Gemma 4 E2B；转写在这台 Mac 上完成，录音不上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn recordings into text. Choose Qwen3-ASR or Gemma 4 E2B in Settings. Transcription runs on this Mac without uploading audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "\n原来的文字稿和纪要都留着没动，可以再试一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nThe existing transcript and notes are untouched. You can try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n录音本身没问题，可以再试一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nThe recording itself is fine. You can try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n换一个文件夹再试试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nTry a different folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n检查一下设置里的分析模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nCheck the analysis model in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  —  %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  —  %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · 余额 %lld 积分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": " · Balance %lld credit"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": " · Balance %lld credits"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · 已花 %lld 积分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": " · %lld credit used"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": " · %lld credits used"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · 没花积分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · No credits used"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "#": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "#"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%.1f 分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%.1f min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%.1f 小时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%.1f hr"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n录音还在卡里，可以再下载一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\nThe recording is still on the card. You can download it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n看看磁盘是不是满了。录音还在密盒里，腾出空间后可以重新下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\nCheck whether the disk is full. The recording is still on Mi Box; you can download it again after freeing up space."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@  %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@  %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@ · %lld 段 · 约 %lld 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@ · %#@n@ · about %4$lld sec"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "n": {
              "argNum": 3,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg segment"
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg segments"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %lld 条素材": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %#@n@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "n": {
              "argNum": 2,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg material"
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg materials"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 已下载 · 10.3 GB": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Downloaded · 10.3 GB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 来自 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ • %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ • %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 上传": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uploaded %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 倍": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@×"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 录音已暂停": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ recording paused"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 正在录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@。传回来 %lld 条，剩下的 %lld 条等蓝牙连上后接着下。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Transferred %lld; the remaining %lld will download over Bluetooth once it connects."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@上次在密盒助手登录的腾讯元宝过期了，再扫一次码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@Your Tencent Yuanbao sign-in in Mi Box Assistant has expired. Scan the code again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@下面打开的就是这条%@，在页面上扫码或输入账号登录，登好了点右边的按钮%@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@Below is this %@ — sign in on the page by scanning or with your account, then click the button on the right%@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@不让从现在的网络下载这条。直连和走代理都试过了，可以换个代理节点，或者关掉代理再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ won't allow downloading this from your current network. Both direct and proxy connections were tried — switch to another proxy node, or turn the proxy off and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@刚登录的腾讯元宝没解析出这条视频%@。可能这条作品不让在网页上看，过一会儿再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@Tencent Yuanbao (just signed in) couldn't resolve this video%@. The post may not be viewable on the web. Try again in a bit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@删除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleted %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@在下面扫码或输入账号登录，登好了点右边的按钮%@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@Sign in below by scanning or with your account, then click the button on the right%@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@嫌请求太频繁，过几分钟再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ says there are too many requests. Try again in a few minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@拒绝了这次下载（403）。可能要登录，或者它最近改了接口，可以先升级 yt-dlp：brew upgrade yt-dlp": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ refused this download (403). It may require sign-in, or it changed its API recently — try upgrading yt-dlp first: brew upgrade yt-dlp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@的麦克风没有开始录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %@ microphone didn't start recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@要登录之后才给看这条内容。可以用别的工具把它下载成文件，再拖进密盒助手的窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ only shows this content after you sign in. You can download it as a file with another tool, then drag it into the Mi Box Assistant window."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@视频下下来了，但抽不出声音，可能是加密过的视频。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@The video downloaded, but its audio couldn't be extracted. It may be encrypted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@视频号网页版不给下载地址，密盒助手借腾讯元宝的视频号解析拿视频。在下面点「登录」用微信扫码，登好了点右边的按钮%@。只要登一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@The WeChat Channels website doesn't give a download link, so Mi Box Assistant gets the video through Tencent Yuanbao's Channels parser. Click “Sign In” below and scan with WeChat; once signed in, click the button on the right%@. You only need to do this once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@视频地址拿到了，但没下下来。看看网络，再试一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@Got the video address, but the download failed. Check your network and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@，%@，%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@, %@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@，共 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@, %@ total"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@，已选中": {
      "localizations": {
