        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file downloaded from “%@” was incomplete and has been deleted. Click “Continue” to download again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」会从卡上永久删除，不能恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” will be permanently deleted from the card. This can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」出现在 %lld 条录音里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” appears in %#@n@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "n": {
              "argNum": 2,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg recording"
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg recordings"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」可能已经被得到 App 同步后清掉了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” may have been cleared after the DeDao app synced it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」已经在素材里，这条会跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is already in Materials; it will be skipped."
          }
        }
