    },
    "「%@」是图文，没有视频或音频，转不了文字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is an image post with no video or audio, so it can't be transcribed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是对话模型，不能转写。转写会用 %@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is a chat model and can't transcribe. Transcription will use %@."
