    "下载好了，但没能放进模型文件夹：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded, but couldn't move it into the model folder: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载完会自动转写整理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They'll be transcribed and summarized automatically after downloading."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载工具没有说明原因。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The download tool didn't give a reason."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载断了会从断点接着下；HuggingFace 太慢时自动换国内镜像，下完按 SHA‑256 校验。本机模型不联网；云端纪要质量更高，但文字稿会发给服务商，录音本身不会。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interrupted downloads resume where they left off; if HuggingFace is too slow it switches to a mirror in China automatically, and verifies with SHA‑256 when done. The local model works offline. Cloud notes are higher quality, but the transcript is sent to the provider; the recording itself is not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
