    },
    "也支持得到 AI 录音卡（按公开协议实现，还没在实机上测过）。手机 App 已经把录音同步进飞书妙记的，可以在最后一步打开「飞书妙记同步」拉回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The DeDao AI recording card is also supported (built from the public protocol, not yet tested on real hardware). If the phone app has already synced your recordings into Feishu Minutes, turn on “Feishu Minutes Sync” in the last step to pull them back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也支持得到 AI 录音卡：打开卡片，手机上的得到 App 连着的话先关掉手机蓝牙，它会出现在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The DeDao AI recording card is supported too: turn on the card, and if the DeDao app on your phone is connected, turn off your phone's Bluetooth first. It will show up here."
          }
