    "交给 Claude 做": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hand Off to Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交给 Claude 桌面版，用 Renoise 的数字人和口播剪辑 skill 一条龙做：写稿、生成出镜、在 Renoise 云端剪辑包装（字幕花字、信息卡、B-roll、音乐），成片自动回到这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hands it off to Claude desktop, which uses Renoise's digital-human and talking-head editing skills end to end: writes the script, generates the presenter footage, and edits and packages it in the Renoise cloud (captions, info cards, B-roll, music). The finished video comes back here automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交给 Claude 桌面版，用 Renoise 的数字人和口播剪辑 skill 做成带包装的成片。会先报价，确认了才开始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hand it to Claude for desktop, which uses Renoise's digital-human and talking-head editing skills to make a finished, packaged video. You'll get a quote first; it only starts once you confirm"
          }
