        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up a cloud model in Settings first, or download a local model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先歇一下。想接着录就点继续，录完了点结束。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taking a break. Click Resume to keep recording, or Stop when you're done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先添加一个主播": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a presenter first"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先用三四行总结这条内容的结构（钩子、怎么展开、怎么收束），然后严格照这个结构和节奏，用「补充要求」里给的选题写一条新的口播稿：结构和手法学它，内容、例子、观点必须是新的，不要照搬原文的句子。如果补充要求里没有给选题，就先列出 3 个适合套用这个结构的选题，再用第一个来写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First summarize this piece's structure in three or four lines (the hook, how it develops, how it wraps up). Then strictly follow that structure and rhythm to write a new talking-head script on the topic given in “Additional requirements”: learn its structure and techniques, but the content, examples and opinions must be new; don't copy sentences from the original. If no topic is given in the additional requirements, first list 3 topics that suit this structure, then write using the first one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先试一次": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try It First"
          }
        }
      }
    },
