    "兼容 OpenAI「/audio/transcriptions」接口的服务都能用；小米 MiMo 走它自己的转写模型。用它转写时，录音会发给这家服务商。密钥存在系统钥匙串里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any service compatible with the OpenAI “/audio/transcriptions” API works; Xiaomi MiMo uses its own transcription model. When you transcribe with it, recordings are sent to that provider. The API key is stored in the system keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内容是空的": {
      "localizations": {
