      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ready to use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能是这个平台不让下载，或者网络不通。声音和文字稿不受影响；也可以点「打开原链接」去平台上看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The platform may not allow downloads, or the network is down. The audio and transcript aren't affected; you can also click “Open Original Link” to watch it on the platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能有别的软件正占着麦克风，或者没有接入任何麦克风。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another app may be using the microphone, or no microphone is connected."
