    },
    "它写稿、逐项核价，报价会同时显示在这里，不花积分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It writes the script and prices each item; the quote shows here too. No credits are spent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能正在传文件，或者电量太低。等几秒再点一次；还不行就充电后重新连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may be transferring files, or its battery is too low. Wait a few seconds and click again; if that doesn't work, charge it and reconnect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能正在录音或传文件。等一会儿再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may be recording or transferring a file. Try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能还在录这一条，或者正在传文件。结束录音、等传完再删。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may still be recording this one, or transferring files. Stop recording and wait for the transfer to finish before deleting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它还没下载到密盒助手，删了就没有了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It hasn't been downloaded to Mi Box Assistant yet. Once deleted, it's gone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
