      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始录音，声音来自：%@（⌘R）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording, audio from: %@ (⌘R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始快传": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Fast Transfer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始搜索": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Searching"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始翻译": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Translating"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时每 30 分钟查一次，新上传的妙记自动拉回来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, checks every 30 minutes and pulls back newly uploaded Minutes automatically"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时点哪句就一直重复那句，适合听不清、跟读（⌥L）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the sentence you click repeats — good for hard-to-hear parts or shadowing (⌥L)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "引擎": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录 5 秒，只显示识别结果，不会打进别的 App。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records 5 seconds and only shows the result. Nothing is typed into other apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录一段试试，录完会出现在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try recording something. It'll show up here when you're done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录一段试试？我来帮你整理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try recording something? I'll summarize it for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录下第一段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record Your First"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录会议软件、视频里的电脑声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record computer audio from meeting apps and videos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录好了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录完一条、或者重新连上密盒时，把还没下载的拉到这台 Mac 上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a recording finishes or Mi Box reconnects, pull anything not yet downloaded to this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录完先问一句留不留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask whether to keep after recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录完弹一张小卡片，不要的话当场删掉，哪里都不留。十秒不理它就默认留着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A small card pops up after recording. If you don't want it, delete it on the spot and nothing is kept. Ignore it for ten seconds and it's kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录完自动变成纪要": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings become notes automatically"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings"
          }
        }
