    "录音卡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音卡不能远程开始录音，在卡上按键录，录完连上就会同步过来。从卡上删除不能恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording card can't start recording remotely. Press the button on the card to record; it syncs over once connected. Deleting from the card can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音卡没有删掉这条录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording card didn't delete this recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音卡没有回传数据。把卡靠近电脑再试一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording card sent no data. Move the card closer to the computer and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音已暂停": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording paused"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音已经传回来 %lld 条。": {
      "localizations": {
