      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't save the recording to this device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音的时候和录完之后": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "During and after recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒、录音卡、Mac 自己录、导入的音频、视频链接、飞书妙记，都在这里，标着来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box, the recording card, recordings made on the Mac, imported audio, video links and Feishu Minutes all live here, labeled by source."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒同一时间只连一台设备，手机上的设备配套 App 或飞书连过它的话，会把录音同步走，这期间新录的也在那边。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box connects to only one device at a time. If the companion app on your phone or Feishu connected to it, the recordings were synced there, and anything recorded meanwhile is there too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
