        }
      }
    },
    "密盒没连上。连接后即可使用；想现在就录，用这台 Mac 也行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box isn't connected. Connect it to get started. To record right now, you can use this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒没连上，用这台 Mac 的麦克风录（⌘R）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box isn't connected; record with this Mac's microphone (⌘R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒没连着，这条还在密盒里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box isn't connected; this recording is still on Mi Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒负责听，密盒助手负责把它变成文字和纪要。接下来几步把要准备的东西过一遍，几分钟就好；每一步都能先跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box listens; Mi Box Assistant turns it into text and notes. The next few steps walk through what to set up and take just a few minutes. You can skip any step for now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒还没准备好，稍等一下": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box isn't ready yet. Wait a moment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
