    },
    "密盒里的录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings on Mi Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒里这一条没有声音数据，可能刚开始就结束了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This one on Mi Box has no audio data; it may have ended right after it started."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音转写整理之后会自动进到这里，不用手动添加。到时候直接问就行。": {
