    "手机上的设备配套 App 先连上密盒的话，录音会被同步进飞书、密盒上就没有了。装好飞书命令行工具并授权后，密盒助手能把它们拉回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the companion app on your phone connects to Mi Box first, recordings get synced into Feishu and disappear from Mi Box. With the Feishu command-line tool installed and authorized, Mi Box Assistant can pull them back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机上的设备配套 App 把录音同步到飞书后，密盒上就没有了。密盒助手从飞书把它们拉回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once the companion app syncs recordings to Feishu, they're gone from Mi Box. Mi Box Assistant pulls them back from Feishu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机设备配套 App 同步进飞书妙记的，从飞书拉回来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synced into Feishu Minutes by the companion app, pulled back from Feishu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机连着它的话，先关掉手机蓝牙": {
