    "确认密盒已开机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make sure Mi Box is turned on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "确认密盒已开机，放在电脑旁边。\n手机连着它的话，先关掉手机蓝牙。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put Mi Box next to your Mac and make sure it is turned on.\nIf your phone is connected to it, turn off Bluetooth on the phone first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把密盒放在 Mac 旁边，并确认已开机。密盒同一时间只能连一台设备：手机上的设备配套 App 连着的话，先关掉手机蓝牙。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put Mi Box next to your Mac and make sure it is turned on. Mi Box connects to one device at a time: if the companion app on your phone is connected, turn off your phone's Bluetooth first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把密盒当随身麦克风：在任何 App 里按住你选的那个键，对着密盒说话，松开后文字出现在光标处。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Mi Box as a portable mic: in any app, hold the key you chose, speak into Mi Box, and when you let go the text appears at the cursor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把录音转成文字。模型约 10.3 GB，下一次就一直能用；转写在这台 Mac 上完成，录音不上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turns recordings into text. The model is about 10.3 GB and only needs downloading once; transcription happens on this Mac and recordings aren't uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把抖音、B 站、YouTube 这些视频链接贴到左边的框里，密盒助手会下载声音、转成文字稿，再整理成纪要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste video links from Douyin, Bilibili, YouTube and the like into the box on the left. Mi Box Assistant downloads the audio, transcribes it, and summarizes it into notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把改写好的稿子做成口播视频要用它。安装和登录也在连接页面里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needed to turn a rewritten script into a talking-head video. Install and sign in on the connection page too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把文字稿整理成摘要、决定、待办和重点。可以用本机模型（不联网），也可以填你自己的云端模型。这一步可以以后再做：没选的时候录音照样转成文字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizes transcripts into a summary, decisions, to-dos and highlights. Use a local model (offline) or your own cloud model. You can do this later: until one is chosen, recordings are still transcribed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把相关的录音和素材放在一起": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep related recordings and materials together"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把相关的录音和素材放在一起，比如一个客户、一次发布、一组选题。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep related recordings and materials together — a client, a launch, a set of topics."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把这段内容当作一条别人发布的视频文案来拆解，目的是学它的写法，不是复述内容。按这几部分写：① 开头钩子：原话是什么，用了什么手法；② 结构：按先后顺序列出每一段在做什么（抛问题、讲故事、给数据、反转、收束），每段一句话；③ 金句：摘出 3 到 5 句最值得学的原话；④ 节奏和语气：句子长短、用第几人称、有什么口头禅；⑤ 结尾怎么引导互动；⑥ 可以直接借用的写法 3 条。只依据文字稿来写，不要猜测播放量之类文字稿里没有的东西。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Break this down as the script of a video someone else published. The goal is to learn how it's written, not to retell the content. Write it in these parts: ① Opening hook: what the exact words are and what technique it uses; ② Structure: list in order what each section does (raise a question, tell a story, give data, twist, wrap up), one sentence per section; ③ Key lines: pick 3 to 5 original lines most worth learning from; ④ Rhythm and tone: sentence length, which person it's written in, any catchphrases; ⑤ How the ending invites engagement; ⑥ 3 techniques you can borrow directly. Base it only on the transcript; don't guess at things the transcript doesn't contain, such as view counts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把选中的录音移到最近删除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Selected Recordings to Recently Deleted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "抓住结论、事实和后续要做的事。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture conclusions, facts and next steps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "报价出来了，在 Claude 里回复确认就开始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The quote is ready. Confirm by replying in Claude to start"
