            "value": "Connect Renoise MCP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接上之后，在你常用的 AI 助手里就能直接问密盒助手里的录音、纪要和待办，也能让它们把内容存进密盒助手。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once connected, you can ask your usual AI assistant about the recordings, notes and to-dos in Mi Box Assistant, and have it save things into Mi Box Assistant."
          }
        }
