    "支持 MCP 的工具都能接。能运行命令的填：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any tool that supports MCP can connect. For tools that run commands, enter:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持抖音、B 站、YouTube、TikTok、X 等公开内容。导入后和录音放在一起，可以拆解写法、照结构仿写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports public content from Douyin, Bilibili, YouTube, TikTok, X and more. Imports sit alongside your recordings, so you can break down how they're written and write your own on the same structure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "收起": {
      "localizations": {
