          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改 ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json，改之前会留一份备份。要在 Claude 完全退出的时候连": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edits ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json, keeping a backup first. Connect while Claude is fully quit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改了 %lld 处": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changed %lld places"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写会按你在设置里选的职业来把握语气。结果由模型生成，发出去之前请自己过一遍。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite adjusts the tone based on the profession you chose in Settings. The result is model-generated — review it yourself before sending it out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写成一封会后跟进邮件：称呼、一句话说明来意、分点列出达成的结论和各自的待办（带负责人和时间）、礼貌收尾。简洁。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite as a follow-up email after the meeting: greeting, one line on the purpose, bullet points of the conclusions reached and each person's to-dos (with owner and date), and a polite close. Keep it brief."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写成一条 60 秒左右的短视频脚本：先给一句钩子，然后按「画面 / 口播」两栏逐镜头写，5 到 8 个镜头，最后给一句行动号召。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite as a short video script of about 60 seconds: start with a one-line hook, then write shot by shot in two columns, “Visual / Voiceover”, 5 to 8 shots, and end with a one-line call to action."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写成一条适合发在社交媒体上的长帖：开头一句话点明观点，中间分 3 到 5 个要点，每点两三句，语气直接，有具体细节和数字，结尾一句总结。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite as a long post for social media: open with one sentence stating the point, then 3 to 5 key points of two or three sentences each, direct in tone, with concrete details and numbers, and a one-line summary at the end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写成一篇公众号文章：有标题，有 3 到 4 个小标题分段，开头用一个场景或问题引入，行文连贯，保留原话里的具体例子。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite as a WeChat article: a title, 3 to 4 sections with subheadings, an opening that starts from a scene or a question, flowing prose, and the concrete examples from the original words kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写成一篇可以直接对着镜头念的口播稿：第一人称，口语但干净利落，开头三句内抛出最抓人的点，短句为主，每段不超过三句，结尾有一句收束。不要小标题，不要表情符号。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite as a talking-head script you can read straight to camera: first person, conversational but crisp, with the most gripping point within the first three sentences. Mostly short sentences, no more than three per paragraph, and a closing line at the end. No subheadings, no emoji."
          }
        }
      }
    },
