    "本机模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转写和本机整理模型都靠它运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local transcription and local summarizing models both run on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转写和本机整理模型都靠它运行。点「安装」会用 Homebrew 装，大约 1 分钟。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local transcription and local summarizing models both run on it. Click Install to set it up with Homebrew, about 1 minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转写和本机整理模型都靠它运行。现在借用的是别的 App 里带的那份，那个 App 删掉就用不了了；建议点「高级」看看位置，或者用 Homebrew 装一份（brew install llama.cpp）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local transcription and local summarizing models both run on it. Right now it's borrowing the copy bundled with another app, which stops working if that app is deleted. Click Advanced to see where it is, or install your own with Homebrew (brew install llama.cpp)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转写和本机整理模型都靠它运行。这台 Mac 上没有 Homebrew，先按链接里的说明装好 llama.cpp。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local transcription and local summarizing models both run on it. This Mac doesn't have Homebrew; install llama.cpp first by following the instructions at the link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转写服务没启动起来：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local transcription service didn't start: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机转得不准的录音，可以在录音页的「⋯」菜单里按需交给云端再转一遍。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings that weren't transcribed accurately on this Mac can be sent to the cloud for another pass from the \"⋯\" menu on the recording page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机运行环境": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local runtime"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "术语、产品名、代码和 API 名保留原文，第一次出现时括注中文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep terms, product names, code and API names in the original, with a translation in parentheses on first use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "术语规范、句式严谨，长句可拆分，不加主观发挥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard terminology and rigorous phrasing; long sentences may be split; no added interpretation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
