          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手的网址入口是通的。Grok Bot 那边有没有填对，要在它里面问一句才知道。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant's URL endpoint is working. Whether Grok Bot is set up right, you'll only know by asking it something."
          }
        }
