    },
    "密盒助手的网址入口没应答，重开一次密盒助手再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant's URL endpoint isn't responding. Reopen Mi Box Assistant and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手要靠「辅助功能」权限来听到这个按键、把文字打进其他 App。没有权限时，文字只会放进剪贴板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant needs Accessibility permission to detect this key and type text into other apps. Without it, the text only goes to the clipboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手还不能录电脑里的声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant can't record computer audio yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手这边正常，但 Claude Code 说没连上：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant is fine, but Claude Code says it isn't connected: %@"
          }
        }
