    },
    "密盒助手这边的入口是通的。%@ 那边要新开一个会话问一句才算真的验证。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant's endpoint is working. To truly verify, start a new session in %@ and ask it something."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手这边的入口没有应答。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi Box Assistant's endpoint isn't responding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密盒助手里「改写」下面的「做成视频」靠它生成数字人口播。它是按积分收费的服务，每次生成前密盒助手都会先报价。": {
      "localizations": {
