    "粘贴任务指令后发送；首次使用请在 TeleAgent 的 MCP 设置中连接 Renoise 并登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste and send the instructions. The first time, connect Renoise in TeleAgent’s MCP settings and sign in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要做就在 TeleAgent 对话里回复确认，它按这个报价加 10% 余量封顶。密盒助手会自动跟进度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reply in TeleAgent to confirm. The quoted amount plus 10% is the spending limit. Mi Box Assistant tracks progress."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在 TeleAgent 新建会话并粘贴任务，报价确认后才花积分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a new TeleAgent session and paste the task. Credits are spent after you approve the quote."
