    "这台 Mac 上没装 TeleAgent，做视频要靠它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install TeleAgent to make a video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分析模型输出超过长度限制，未生成完整结果。请重试或更换模型；改写时也可以缩短成品要求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The analysis model reached its output limit before completing the result. Retry or choose another model. For rewrites, you can also ask for a shorter result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改写要求太长，本机模型无法容纳，请缩短要求后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The instructions exceed the local model’s context. Shorten them and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机模型上下文不足，无法整理这段材料。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local model does not have enough context to process this material."
          }
