      }
    },
    "本机模型没有返回分段要点，请重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local model returned no notes for a section. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机模型未能压缩长材料，请重试或选择更简洁的改写要求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local model could not condense the material. Try again or simplify the instructions."
