          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在这台 Mac 上运行，录音不会上传。Paraformer 使用应用内的转写程序，不需要 llama-server。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs on this Mac without uploading recordings. Paraformer uses the runtime included with the app and does not require llama-server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR、Gemma 4 E2B 和本机整理模型靠它运行；Paraformer 不需要它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qwen3-ASR, Gemma 4 E2B and local summary models require this runtime. Paraformer does not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR、Gemma 4 E2B 和本机整理模型靠它运行；Paraformer 不需要它。现在借用的是别的 App 里带的那份，那个 App 删掉就用不了了；建议点「高级」看看位置，或者用 Homebrew 装一份（brew install llama.cpp）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qwen3-ASR, Gemma 4 E2B and local summary models require this runtime. Paraformer does not. The current copy belongs to another app and will stop working if that app is removed. Check its location under Advanced, or install a separate copy with Homebrew (brew install llama.cpp)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR、Gemma 4 E2B 和本机整理模型靠它运行；Paraformer 不需要它。点「安装」会用 Homebrew 装，大约 1 分钟。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qwen3-ASR, Gemma 4 E2B and local summary models require this runtime. Paraformer does not. Click Install to install it with Homebrew, which takes about a minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR、Gemma 4 E2B 和本机整理模型靠它运行；Paraformer 不需要它。这台 Mac 上没有 Homebrew，先按链接里的说明装好 llama.cpp。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qwen3-ASR, Gemma 4 E2B and local summary models require this runtime. Paraformer does not. This Mac does not have Homebrew. Follow the linked instructions to install llama.cpp."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择 Qwen3-ASR、Gemma 4 E2B 或 Paraformer；转写在这台 Mac 上完成，录音不上传。选中 Paraformer 后会下载缺少的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
